msgstr ""

msgid "A chapter of a study"
msgstr "Un capitolo di uno studio"

msgid "A chapter of one of your studies, or of a new one; its link to open or copy."
msgstr "Un capitolo di uno dei tuoi studi, o di uno nuovo; il suo link da aprire o copiare."

msgid "A click adds it to the active repertoire"
msgstr "Un clic la aggiunge al repertorio attivo"

msgid "A click asks Lichess for their games of the last year and their public profile: their name and those filters only."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click asks Lichess's explorer for this position, as the Tree tab does: the position and its filters only."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click chooses the game; a double click follows it on the board."
msgstr "Un clic sceglie la partita; un doppio clic la segue sulla scacchiera."

msgid "A click goes to the move"
msgstr "Un clic porta alla mossa"

msgid "A click goes to the move it is about"
msgstr "Un clic porta alla mossa di cui parla"

msgid "A click goes to the move · the right button: the line it expected, on the board or as a variation, and its comment as it is"
msgstr "Un clic porta alla mossa · il tasto destro: la linea che si aspettava, sulla scacchiera o come variante, e il suo commento così com'è"

msgid "A click on a cell takes that field from that source. The merged game keeps the number of the oldest (No. {}); the other is marked deleted, and Ctrl+Z brings it back. Where each field came from is kept with the game (its MergedFrom tag); a broadcast's game keeps its source."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on a game opens it on the Board page, with this dossier as its list (Ctrl+← and Ctrl+→)."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on a game opens it, on a name their dossier, on a tie-break's heading changes the tie-breaks, kept for this tournament. The rating change: FIDE's formula, each player's K from FIDE's list when they are matched with it, else by FIDE's rules."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on a line opens it on the Board page, the Tree tab on their games alone, from their side."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on a move shows it, in a variation too; ← and → go through the moves, F turns the board over."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on a square then empties it. A right click empties a square whatever is chosen."
msgstr "Un clic su una casa allora la svuota. Un clic destro svuota una casa, qualunque pezzo sia scelto."

msgid "A click on a square: a white pawn, a black pawn, nothing."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click on the curve goes to the move. The dots are the key moments: dark for a good move, orange for a mistake."
msgstr "Un clic sulla curva porta alla mossa. I punti sono i momenti chiave: scuri per una buona mossa, arancioni per un errore."

msgid "A click opens it on the Board; your move is played there."
msgstr "Un clic la apre sulla Scacchiera; la tua mossa si gioca lì."

msgid "A click opens one, the right button on a changed one discards its changes; Ctrl+Tab from any page of a view whose Board is for study"
msgstr "Un clic ne apre una, il tasto destro su una partita modificata ne scarta le modifiche; Ctrl+Tab da qualsiasi pagina di una vista con la Scacchiera per lo studio"

msgid "A click opens their dossier."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click plays an endgame; then ↑ ↓ choose another and Enter plays it."
msgstr "Un clic gioca un finale; poi ↑ ↓ ne scelgono un altro e Invio lo gioca."

msgid "A click plays it on the Board page"
msgstr ""

msgid "A click plays the move on the Board page; ↑ ↓ and Enter as in the Tree tab; the evaluation's source and depth at the cursor."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click puts it first, moves, replaces or removes it."
msgstr ""

msgid "A click puts the man chosen (again: takes it away); Shift and a click: an empty square; the rest: anything."
msgstr "Un clic mette il pezzo scelto (di nuovo: lo toglie); Maiusc e un clic: una casa vuota; il resto: qualsiasi cosa."

msgid "A click sets its criteria · the right button: rename, delete · in Ctrl+K too"
msgstr "Un clic ne imposta i criteri · il tasto destro: rinomina, elimina · anche in Ctrl+K"

msgid "A click shows its {} game in the list"
msgid_plural "A click shows its {} games in the list"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

